dsh-pet's card view passes its children to jsx as arrays without keys, so React warned in
development on every render ('Each child in a list should have a unique "key" prop. Check the
render method of `CardView`'). Each child now carries a key, jsx's third argument. The
bubble is a child of the root that every slot fills with its own element, so they all take
the same key: React reuses the bubble across slots as it did by position.

